#AREA Abyssal Depths~

#AUTHORS Grimace~

#HELPS
-1 abyssal depths~
{110}Little is known about the Abyss, and I have been unable to obtain
much information about the ancient machinery which pulses underneath
the domed city of Atlantis, as the citizens there are protective of their 
life-breathing treasures.  It is rumoured that much of the water on the
Eastern Continent is under the direct control of the Atlantis water works, 
but such rumours are largely unsubstantiated.  Explore at your own risk.
                               
			            -Grimace{300} 3/97

					(LAST UPDATE: 3/12/98)~
0 $~

#RANGES 50 95 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NOTELEPORT
#MOBILES
#31200
hermit crab~
A hermit crab~
A large shell suddenly sprouts legs and scurries through the mud.~
The crab has stolen a roomy conch for its abode.  You wonder 
what treasures might be contained within.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_HIDE
0 S
20 BODY_EYE BODY_MOUTH 1d1+297 1d1+17
5 RACE_HALFLING
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>bribe_prog 100000~
mpecho A pair of leg irons slip out of the crab's shell, fall 
mpecho to the bottom and sink partially into the mud.
mpoload 31200
mpquiet ON
drop legirons
mpquiet OFF
~
|
