gardener~
A gardener~
A gardener stands here, looking as if he is about to cry.~
The gardener is quite soggy and his desperation is obvious.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
0
1000 S
150 BODY_EYE BODY_EYE 11d1111+11073 1d1+422
1 RACE_HALFLING
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>give_prog I31206~
hug $n
dance $r
say I think this'll do the trick!  You're a lifesaver.
mpecho The gardener stops the water gushing from the broken pipe with one quick turn.
say Hey I think my brother told me about you.
say He's a dome worker up in the city.
say You're a real philanthropist.  I'm sorry I don't 
say have much to offer as reward....
say How about a head of my finest lettuce?
mpoload 31208
remove I31208
give I31208 $n
mpforce $n smile
mpforce $n beer
wave $n
mpforce $n east
mpjunk I31206
mpjunk all
~
|
