air lock operator drunk man~
The air lock operator~
A drunk air lock operator in overalls greets you with a crooked smile.~
The air lock operator seems a bit too intoxicated 
to be in charge of such a vital function.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
0
0 S
150 BODY_EYE BODY_EYE 11d111+19961 1d1+303
111111 RACE_HALFLING
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>give_prog lettuce~
if hasobjnum(31208)
  smile $n
  mpmset $n quest 0 1 1
  mpjunk all
endif
~
>give_prog magazine~
if hasobjnum(31209)
  mpecho The operator finds the centerfold, flips it open and cracks a lewd smile.
  mpmset $n quest 2 1 1
  mpjunk all
endif
~
>give_prog flask~
if hasobjnum(31213)
  grin $n
  drink water flask
  say WATER?!  Disgusting!
  say Ah well, it's the thought that counts.
  wink $n
  mpmset $n quest 4 1 1
  mpjunk all
endif
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest (0,1,$n) == 1 
& if quest (2,1,$n) == 1 
& if quest (4,1,$n) == 1
  say Hey buddy... wanna explore around outside a bit?
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest (0,1,$n)  == 1 
& if quest (2,1,$n) == 1 
& if quest (4,1,$n) == 1
  mptransfer $n 31665
endif
~
|
