>speech_prog shuttle~
mpecho The membrane parts all of a sudden, allowing a small sealed vessel to pass.
mpecho Your party climbs into a door which pops open, then closes tightly.
mpecho The membrane parts once again, and you speed off into the darkness.
mpecho 
mpecho 
mpecho 
mpecho Before long, you arrive at another dock behind another protective membrane.
mpecho As soon as you exit the vehicle, the shuttle quickly disappears into the sea once again.
mptransfer 'all' 31245
~
