111111 RACE_HALFLING
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>speech_prog p pull lever 1~
if quest(0,1,self)==0
mpechoat $n You pull the lever toward the floor.
mpechoaround $n $n pulls a lever toward the floor.
mpecho You hear the gushing of water through pipes
mpecho accompanied by distant quacking...
mpmset self quest 0 1 1
mpgoto 894
mpecho You hear a furious quacking as the pond drains through a grate!
mpecho A duck flaps its wings and flies off.
mptransfer pcs 31296
mpgoto 876
mpecho You hear the gurgling of water to the west.
connect 3 31296 both
mpgoto 31214
else
if quest(0,1,self)==1
mpechoat $n The lever has already been pulled.
endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p push lever 1~
if quest(0,1,self)==1
mpechoat $n You push the lever back toward the ceiling.
mpechoaround $n $n pushes a lever toward the ceiling.
mpecho You hear the gushing of water through pipes.
mpmset self quest 0 1 0
mpgoto 31296
mpecho Suddenly the pond is flooded by a stream of water from the pipe!
mpecho A duck gracefully glides in from the sky and settles on the pond.
mptransfer all 894
mpgoto 876
mpecho You hear the gurgling of water to the west.
connect 3 894 both
mpgoto 31214
else
if quest(0,1,self)==0
mpechoat $n The lever has already been pushed.
endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p pull lever 2~
if quest(2,1,self)==0
mpechoat $n You pull the lever toward the floor.
mpechoaround $n $n pulls a lever toward the floor.
mpecho You hear the gushing of water through pipes,
mpecho then a humming over your head...
mpmset self quest 2 1 1
mpgoto 15613
mpecho The reflecting pool shimmers!
connect 5 28793
mpgoto 31214
else
if quest(2,1,self)==1
mpechoat $n The lever has already been pulled.
endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p push lever 2~
if quest(2,1,self)==1
mpechoat $n You push the lever back toward the ceiling.
mpechoaround $n $n pushes a lever toward the ceiling.
mpecho You hear the gushing of water through pipes.
mpmset self quest 2 1 0
mpgoto 15613
mpecho The reflecting pool shimmers!
connect 5 15614
mpgoto 31214
else
if quest(2,1,self)==0
mpechoat $n The lever has already been pushed.
endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p pull lever 3~
if quest(4,1,self)==0
mpechoat $n You pull the lever toward the floor.
mpechoaround $n $n pulls a lever toward the floor.
mpecho You hear the gushing of water through pipes
mpecho accompanied by the distant groaning of university students...
mpmset self quest 4 1 1
mpgoto 19812
mppurge
mpecho You hear the gurgling of water as the fountain drains!
mpgoto 31214
else
if quest(4,1,self)==1
mpechoat $n The lever has already been pulled.
endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p push lever 3~
if quest(4,1,self)==1
mpechoat $n You push the lever back toward the ceiling.
mpechoaround $n $n pushes a lever toward the ceiling.
mpecho Nothing happens.
mpmset self quest 4 1 0
else
if quest(4,1,self)==0
mpechoat $n The lever has already been pushed.
endif
endif
~
