The Mechanical Room~
You find yourself in the center of a large mechanical room
illuminated by dirty yellow light bulbs hung from the ceiling
high above.  There are a row of pumps at the east end of the room
which anchor the enormous pipes which lead into a hole in the ceiling.
The rest of the room is filled with machines of all shapes and sizes,
including an enormous chiller, an air scrubber and a furnace of some
sort.~
