edge, you see the shaft has sheer steel walls, and there is a grate guarding
the top of the shaft far above.  You cannot see the bottom of the shaft, but
you imagine that this is some sort of garbage chute, judging from the refuse
smeared over the edge of the floor into the shaft.  There is a small ledge on
the opposite side of the shaft.  As turn to leave, you catch a glimpse of 
something shiny upon it.~
