#31230
Trapped at the Bottom of the Shaft~
That caught you by surprise.  As you check to make sure nothing is
broken from the fall, you realize that your leg is trapped under a pile
of garbage which completely fills the bottom of the shear-walled steel
shaft.  In fact, you are immersed in the pile of rotting, half-decayed
garbage, and your nose is quickly overpowered and ceases to function.
As you slowly sink into the pile, you glimpse a hallway leading away 
to the north far overhead.  You have no chance of reaching it, however,
and you realize that you are soon to become compost.~
