#31279
Viewing Deck~
You are overcome as you climb up onto the viewing deck.  The room
is more of a pod than a room, a bubble with a wraparound view of the
ocean outside.  Laterally, you can make out the dome stretching
out as far as you can see, flashing and pulsating with strange lights
and colors.  Out in the murky sea above, you catch an occasional 
glimpse of a florescent fish or squid, but beyond that lies only 
darkness.  The deck glows with the dark blue of the ocean about, 
the ocean lit only by light from the domed city of Atlantis.  
You suddenly feel cold, dark and alone.~
312 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_DOWN
A ladder leads back down.~
