#31296
The Drained Pond~
All that is left of this once idyllic pond is a thick grey mud which
sucks at your legs.  A small pipe protrudes from the mud at one end
of the pond, capped with a small grate.  A few copper and silver coins
sparkle in the sunlight, but not enough to make a full-scale 
reclamation very profitable.  A leech attaches itself to your foot.~
312 ROOM_NO_MOB SECT_FIELD
S
#31301
The Air Ducts~
The endless droning of the turbines threatens to shred your eardrums
as you slip and slide on the slick metal floor of the air duct.  You brace
your body against the force of the air being moved to the city above and
ponder the bowels of this vast machinery.  A HUGE turbine churns here.~
312 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_DOWN
The ducts lead off in that direction.~
~
