curmudgeonly man with hair to his feet and a beard to match.  Bits of plants
and the bones from a dozen small rodents litter the floor.  The air is musty
and smells of decay.~
312 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_CITY
DDIR_WEST
The tunnel leads away to the west.~
~
0 -1 31354
S
#31356
An Abandoned Tunnel~
You find yourself in a dark tunnel.  The smell of body odor and old meat is
strong.  Whatever this tunnel was used for when the city planners created
it, it isn't used for that anymore.~
