A Shuttle Bay~
You are standing in a damp room.  The salt in the air stings your eyes, 
and the aroma of decaying sea sludge creeps in from behind a membrane which 
makes up the south end of the room.  A hallway leads away to the north.
A small panel on the wall looks to be waiting for you to say something.~
