#31595
The Air Lock~
There is a hole filled with water in the middle of the floor, and a hatch
stands open to the south.  Air pressure in the room must balance the
pressure of the water below, because your ears feel like they're about to
explode.  Several pipes gape at you from across the room, and you feel
suddenly quite cold.~
