passage through the tortuous caves of the {710}Abyss{110} to the ocean
far above your head.  If you do happen upon Neptune's Garden,
be warned that this area is for experienced players only.
While the rumours of its treasures are said to be accurate,
you can be sure that the rumours of its nasty traps and tricks
are equally accurate.

         -Grimace    6/13/97{300}~
