#31643
The Docking Bay~
You find yourself standing at the end of a filthy platform.  
Clouds of black ash partially blot out the ochre light 
which is escaping a small dirty light bulb in the ceiling.  
An ash-caked hallway leads off to the north, and a thin 
membrane prevents passage to the west. A small panel on the wall
looks to be waiting for you to say something.~
312 0 SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
